ssign priority", "", "", "Verify fix with the customer", ""]}, {"actor": "Engineering", "steps": ["", "", "Diagnose the root cause", "Deploy and monitor the fix", "", ""]}]}}}, {"layout_id": "blank-title", "slide_type": "content", "source": "Illustrative", "content": [{"placeholder_id": "title", "type": "text", "text_value": "table-highlight pattern, exemplar values"}], "pattern": {"name": "table-highlight", "values": {"criteria": [{"label": "Cost"}, {"label": "Time to value"}, {"label": "Scalability"}, {"label": "Delivery risk"}], "options": [{"name": "Build in-house", "detail": "Custom platform", "scores": ["1", "1", "4", "2"]}, {"name": "Buy SaaS suite", "detail": "Configure and integrate", "scores": ["3", "4", "3", "3"]}, {"name": "Partner / JV", "detail": "Shared investment", "scores": ["2", "2", "3", "1"]}], "highlight_row": 1, "highlight_label": "Recommended"}}}, {"layout_id": "blank-title", "slide_type": "content", "source": "Illustrative", "content": [{"placeholder_id": "title", "type": "text", "text_value": "team-bios pattern, exemplar values"}], "pattern": {"name": "team-bios", "values": {"members": [{"name": "Jane Smith", "role": "Project Lead", "bio": "10 years in supply-chain strategy. Previously at McKinsey."}, {"name": "Arun Patel", "role": "Lead Engineer", "bio": "Built data platforms at two scale-ups. MIT alumnus."}, {"name": "Lila Romero", "role": "Design Lead", "bio": "Service-design specialist. Ex-IDEO, ex-Frog."}, {"name": "Tom Becker", "role": "Client Partner", "bio": "Account director for top-10 retailers. Frankfurt office."}]}}}, {"layout_id": "blank-title", "slide_type": "content", "source": "Illustrative", "content": [{"placeholder_id": "title", "type": "text", "text_value": "text-sidebar pattern, exemplar values"}], "pattern": {"name": "text-sidebar", "values": {"heading": "Introduction", "paragraphs": ["We meet often with CEOs, CFOs and CIOs to discuss AI \u2014 a topic that is both captivating and evolving rapidly. After working with more than 2,500 clients over the past three years, we are **sharing our most recent insights** in a new series for the C-suite.", "In this edition we discuss the future of asset management and the role agentic AI will play in separating those who successfully implement it from those who do not. We address the questions executives ask most:"], "bullets": ["How do recent advances in agentic AI affect our strategy?", "We have run AI pilots for two years and the ROI is underwhelming \u2014 what are the best doing differently?", "What does an end-to-end AI-first operating model look like?"], "sidebar": "In this perspective, we outline how AI-first asset managers unlock end-to-end transformation and sustained value creation"}}}, {"layout_id": "blank-title", "slide_type": "content", "source": "Illustrative", "content": [{"placeholder_id": "title", "type": "text", "text_value": "timeline-horizontal pattern, exemplar values"}], "pattern": {"name": "timeline-horizontal", "values": [{"label": "Discovery", "date": "Q1 2025", "body": "Baseline costs and interview 40 stakeholders"}, {"label": "Pilot", "date": "Q2 2025", "body": "Run the new model in two regions"}, {"label": "Scale-up", "date": "Q3 2025", "body": "Roll out to all twelve markets"}]}}, {"layout_id": "blank-title", "slide_type": "content", "source": "Illustrative", "content": [{"placeholder_id": "title", "type": "text", "text_value": "value-chain pattern, exemplar values"}], "pattern": {"name": "value-chain", "values": {"steps": [{"label": "Extraction", "description": "Mining raw materials and managing EPC contracts."}, {"label": "Processing", "description": "Refining ore into intermediate inputs."}, {"label": "Manufacturing", "description": "Converting inputs into finished goods.", "highlight": true}, {"label": "Distribution", "description": "Moving product through wholesale channels."}, {"label": "Retail", "description": "Reaching end customers via partner stores."}]}}}, {"layout_id": "blank-title", "slide_type": "co